    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h1>SiNKR 3</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/973220/extras/45900044005555afb365836511ceb324.poster.avif?t=1667404525\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/973220/extras/45900044005555afb365836511ceb324.webm?t=1667404525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/973220/extras/45900044005555afb365836511ceb324.mp4?t=1667404525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>SiNKR 2 is a minimalist puzzle game evolved from the award winning SiNKR. There is just you, hooks, pucks, and various contraptions. SiNKR 2 employs familiar contraptions (square and round holes, kickers, and portals) in new layouts, e.g. spirals; linear and rotational symmetry. <br><br>Subtle differences within level themes drive different solutions to superficially similar scenarios.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Carried over from SiNKR</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Tutorial levels (no SiNKR experience needed)<br></li><li>Advanced levels allow for multiple solutions<br></li><li>No scores, no timers, no distractions<br></li><li>Responsive ambient soundscape<br></li><li>No text, suitable for all languages</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Improved flow through the game</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Mini-map level selector with challenge ratings from * to ***<br></li><li>Multiple paths to complete the game <br></li><li>Skippable levels</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/973220/extras/2c62b1ac1959112f637b2aa727ce2b5d.poster.avif?t=1667404525\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/973220/extras/2c62b1ac1959112f637b2aa727ce2b5d.webm?t=1667404525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/973220/extras/2c62b1ac1959112f637b2aa727ce2b5d.mp4?t=1667404525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Playtime 3.5 hours (speedy) to 4.5 hours (relaxed). Thanks for playing and have fun!",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/973220/extras/45900044005555afb365836511ceb324.poster.avif?t=1667404525\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/973220/extras/45900044005555afb365836511ceb324.webm?t=1667404525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/973220/extras/45900044005555afb365836511ceb324.mp4?t=1667404525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>SiNKR 2 is a minimalist puzzle game evolved from the award winning SiNKR. There is just you, hooks, pucks, and various contraptions. SiNKR 2 employs familiar contraptions (square and round holes, kickers, and portals) in new layouts, e.g. spirals; linear and rotational symmetry. <br><br>Subtle differences within level themes drive different solutions to superficially similar scenarios.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Carried over from SiNKR</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Tutorial levels (no SiNKR experience needed)<br></li><li>Advanced levels allow for multiple solutions<br></li><li>No scores, no timers, no distractions<br></li><li>Responsive ambient soundscape<br></li><li>No text, suitable for all languages</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Improved flow through the game</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Mini-map level selector with challenge ratings from * to ***<br></li><li>Multiple paths to complete the game <br></li><li>Skippable levels</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/973220/extras/2c62b1ac1959112f637b2aa727ce2b5d.poster.avif?t=1667404525\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/973220/extras/2c62b1ac1959112f637b2aa727ce2b5d.webm?t=1667404525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https